    "body": "Keep it as 1.0.  We have stopped using subminor version numbers.\r\n\r\nAs new extensions are added, Zkt will be expanded as a property of those new extensions--not because Zkt has changed with respect to extensions that already existed.  So the version number should stay constant.",
